Task: Phase 3 Green — implement Catalog screen (track catalog_20261008)

Why: minimum code to pass the Red-phase tests — read-only browse screen with
manual "Load more" pagination, per spec.md.

Changes:
- src/screens/Catalog/Catalog.tsx (new): fetches first page on mount via
  catalogClient.list(); initial loading/error+Retry states; Load more button
  appends next page (offset = items.length) and hides once items.length
  reaches total; load-more error+Retry shown without discarding existing
  items; formatPrice() converts priceCents to "$X.XX".
- src/screens/Catalog/Catalog.css (new): minimal list/error styling, matches
  App.css's plain-CSS pattern.
- src/test/setup.ts: added afterEach(cleanup) — discovered RTL doesn't
  auto-register its cleanup without a global `afterEach` (Jest, or Vitest's
  `globals: true`); without it, multiple component renders across tests in
  the same file were stacking up in the DOM, causing one Catalog test to see
  duplicate "Widget" text from a prior test's uncleaned render.

Verified Green: npx vitest run — 10/10 passed (both test files). npm run
build and npm run lint both clean.
